#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1"
