msgstr "Con dê này bé tí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
