#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
