#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD"
