#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
