#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
