#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING"
