#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
